1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,615
Every night at midnight,

2
00:00:01,665 --> 00:00:04,113
something knocks on my bedroom door.

3
00:00:04,163 --> 00:00:05,133
Three times.

4
00:00:05,183 --> 00:00:06,268
Never more.

5
00:00:06,417 --> 00:00:07,627
Mother always said,

6
00:00:07,677 --> 00:00:09,148
never answer it.

7
00:00:09,378 --> 00:00:09,793
Tonight,

8
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:11,517
it knocked four times.

9
00:00:11,747 --> 00:00:13,886
The fourth came from behind me.

10
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:16,248
Don't turn around.
